   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-24-basic-supplies" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "24" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Basic Supplies" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Vegetable" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "You immediately get goods until you have at least 1 fuel, 1 food, 1 wood, 1 clay, 1 reed, 1 stone, and 1 grain in your supply." :printed-cost {:vegetable 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-25-household-inventory" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "25" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Household Inventory" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Food" :prerequisites "1 Field, 1 Pasture or 1 Stable" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "If you have exactly 5/6/7/8/9/10 unused farmyard spaces, you immediately get the following 1/2/3/4/5/6 goods (in this order): 1 reed, 1 grain, 1 cattle, 1 stone, 1 vegetable, 1 horse." :printed-cost {:food 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-26-chimney-hood" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "26" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Chimney Hood" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Clay" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "You immediately get as much food as you would get from one of your baking improvements if you baked 1 grain." :printed-cost {:clay 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-27-garden-path" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "27" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Garden Path" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Clay" :prerequisites "At Least 1 Forest" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "You immediately get 3 wood. The player to your left must immediately place the \"Garden Path\" token in front of them." :printed-cost {:clay 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-28-out-on-the-wallaby" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "28" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Out on the Wallaby" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "You immediately get goods for each craft building that you have: 3 wood for the Joinery, 3 clay for the Pottery, 2 reed for the Basketmaker's Workshop" :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-29-tinker" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "29" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Tinker" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Food" :prerequisites "3 Major Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "If you have at least one of the \"Joinery\", \"Pottery\", or \"Basketmaker's Workshop\" major improvements, you immediately get 1 wood, 1 clay, 1 reed, and 1 stone." :printed-cost {:food 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-30-farm-animal-market" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "30" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Farm Animal Market" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Food" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "You can immediately exchange exactly 2 sheep for 1 cattle and 1 horse. (You may not exchange only 1 sheep.)" :printed-cost {:food 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-31-livestock-market" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "31" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Livestock Market" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "5 Animals" :points-text "" :passing? true :text "You can immediately exchange up to 3 animals (of any type) at the same time, if you can accommodate them: Sheep → Wild Boar → Cattle → Horse" :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-32-peat-hut" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "32" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Peat Hut" :min-players 1 :cost-text "5 Fuel,2 Reed" :prerequisites "" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "This card provides room for one person. In the feeding phase of each harvest, it must be heated with 1 fuel. Instead of a \"Renovation\" action, you can remove this card from play and add 1 wooden room to you wood house at no cost." :printed-cost {:reed 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-33-night-pasture" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "33" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Night Pasture" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Clay" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "You can keep up to 3 animals of any type on this card; the other players can each keep an additional 1 animal on it. The animals on this card count as only yours when animals breed. You are always the last player to breed in the breeding phase." :printed-cost {:clay 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-34-home-wood" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "34" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Home Wood" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "3 Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "You can keep exactly 1 animal—except sheep—on each farmyard space containing at least 1 forest." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-35-horse-trough" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "35" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Horse Trough" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Stone" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "You can keep up to 2 horses in an unused farmyard space adjacent to your house. Even if you do, this farmyard space is still considered unused. You can change in which farmyard space you keep the horses." :printed-cost {:stone 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-36-peat-moss" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "36" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Peat Moss" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "No Moors" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Wooden rooms only cost you 3 wood and 1 reed each." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-37-building-plan" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "37" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Building Plan" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Food" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Each time after you build at least 2 roms at once, you can build up to 2 tables without paying wood." :printed-cost {:food 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-38-nature-reserve" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "38" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Nature Reserve" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Food" :prerequisites "1 Pasture" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Immediately fence a farmyard space containing at least 1 forest or moor that is adjacent to a pasture, without paying wood for the fences. Once there are no tiles left in the fenced area, the farmyard space becomes a pasture." :printed-cost {:food 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-39-special-pasture" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "39" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Special Pasture" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Wood" :prerequisites "1 Pasture" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Immediately fence a farmyard space that is not adjacent to an existing pasture, without paying wood for the fences. You can connect your pastures later. All future pastures must be adjacent to at least one existing pasture." :printed-cost {:wood 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-40-moor-fire" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "40" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Moor Fire" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "2 Moors" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Once you only have 1 remaining moor, at any time, you can exchange it for 1 field tile." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-41-cattle-collar" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "41" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Cattle Collar" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Wood" :prerequisites "Play in Round 8 or Later" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Each time after you use the \"Farmland\" or \"Cultivation\" action space or take the \"Slash and Burn\" special action, if you have at least 1 cattle, you can plow 1 additional field." :printed-cost {:wood 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-42-deep-plow" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "42" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Deep Plow" :min-players 1 :cost-text "3 Wood" :prerequisites "2 Improvements" :points-text "2" :passing? false :text "You can immediately place 1 moor on an unused farmyard space. Each time you use the \"Farmland\" or \"Cultivation\" action space, you can also exchange 1 moor for 1 field tile." :printed-cost {:wood 3}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-43-wild-fields" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "43" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Wild Fields" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Food" :prerequisites "2 Fields" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Each time after you build at least 2 rooms at once, you can build up to 2 stables without paying wood." :printed-cost {:food 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-44-swamp" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "44" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Swamp" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "Play in Round 4 or Before" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Place 1 morr on round space 12. At the start of that round, you can place the moor on an unused farmyard space." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-45-tree-nursery" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "45" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Tree Nursery" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Wood" :prerequisites "No Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Place 1 forest each on the round spaces 12 and 13. At the start of these rounds, you can place the forest on an unused farmyard space." :printed-cost {:wood 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-46-thicket" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "46" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Thicket" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "4 Forests" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Choose up to 2 of your forests and place 1 additional forest on top of each of them. You cannot take the \"Slash and Burn\" special action on these farmyard spaces unless you remove a tile with a \"Fell Trees\" special action first." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-47-bog-forest" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "47" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Bog Forest" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Food" :prerequisites "3 Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Place 1 forest each on as many of your moors as you wish. You cannot take the \"Slash and Burn\" special action or use the covered moor on these farmaryard spaces unless you remove the forest with a \"Fell Trees\" special action first." :printed-cost {:food 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-48-forest-swamp" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "48" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Forest Swamp" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "2 Major Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Each time you take the \"Cut Peat\" special action, add 4 to the current round and place 1 forest on the corresponding round space. At the start of that round, you can place the forest on an unused farmyard space." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-49-surveyor-s-map" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "49" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Surveyor's Map" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Food" :prerequisites "Play in Round 2 or before" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Place a field tile on round space 11, a moor on round space 12, and a forest on round space 13. At the start of these rounds, you can place the respective tile on an unused farmyard space (per the normal rules)." :printed-cost {:food 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-50-farm-extension" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "50" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Farm Extension" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Clay" :prerequisites "" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Place a farmyard extension at one of the four sides of your farmyard board. Both new farmyard spaces must be adjacent to existing farmyard spaces." :printed-cost {:clay 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-51-moor-enclosures" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "51" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Moor Enclosures" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Stone" :prerequisites "Clay House" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Place a farmyard extension at one of the four sides of your farmyard board and place 1 moor on each of the 2 new farmyard spaces. Both new farmyard spaces must be adjacent to existing farmyard spaces." :printed-cost {:stone 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-52-wedding-coach" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "52" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Wedding Coach" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Wood,1 Vegetable" :prerequisites "4 Horses" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "When you play this card, you can immediately take a \"Family Growth without Room\" action without placing a person. Place the newborn on this card until the returning home phase." :printed-cost {:wood 2 :vegetable 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-53-forest-hut" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "53" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Forest Hut" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Wood" :prerequisites "" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Place 1 person from your supply on a forest. Once you remove the forest, you can place the person that round. In the returning home phase of the round, return the person to your supply. Until then, you cannot use it for family growth." :printed-cost {:wood 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-54-agricultural-implement" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "54" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Agricultural Implement" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Wood" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Immediately after each time you use the \"Farmland\" or \"cultivation\" action space, you can take a face-up special action card. (The special action card costs 0 or 2 food, as usual.)" :printed-cost {:wood 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-55-tool-shed" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "55" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Tool Shed" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Wood,1Clay" :prerequisites "2 Improvements" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Once per round, immediately before or after you take the \"Slash and Burn\" or \"Cut Peat\" special action, you can also take the respective other special action." :printed-cost {:wood 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-56-peat-cutting-rights" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "56" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Peat-Cutting Rights" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "1 Horse" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Add 4 and 7 to the current round and place 1 fuel on each corresponding round space. At the start of these rounds, you can discard the fuel and take the \"Cut Peat\" special action by taking the appropriate special action card." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-57-taps" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "57" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Taps" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "2 Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "In each work phase, after you have placed all of your people, when it would be your turn again, you get exactly one more turn in which you can take a face-up special action card. (The special action card costs 0 or 2 food, as usual.)" :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-58-peat-fertilizer" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "58" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Peat Fertilizer" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "2 Fields" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Each time after you take the \"Cut Peat\" special action, you can also take a \"Sow\" action." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-59-nature-s-fertilizer" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "59" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Nature's Fertilizer" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Food" :prerequisites "1 Major Improvement" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Each time after you take the \"Slash and Burn\" special action, you also get a \"Sow\" action for the new field only. This also applies when you exchange 1 moore for 1 field tile via a minor improvement." :printed-cost {:food 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-60-sowing-machine" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "60" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Sowing Machine" :min-players 1 :cost-text "3 Wood" :prerequisites "1 Horse" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Each time after you take a special action, if you then have at least 2 horses, you can also take a \"Sow\" action." :printed-cost {:wood 3}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-61-hay-wagon" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "61" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Hay Wagon" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Wood" :prerequisites "2 Horses" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Each time after you take at least 3 wood, 3 clay, 2 reed, or 2 stone from an accumulation space, you can take a \"Build Rooms\" or \"Renovation\" action without placing a person." :printed-cost {:wood 2}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-62-hearth-brush" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "62" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Hearth Brush" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Reed" :prerequisites "" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "You can immediately move up the Tiled Oven. From the next round on, you can build it immediately after a person action by paying its cost. During scoring, it is worth 1 additional bonus point for you." :printed-cost {:reed 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-63-personal-letter" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "63" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Personal Letter" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "2 Major Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "You can immediately move up the Village Church. From the next round on, you can build it immediately after a person action by paying its cost. During scoring, the Church and Village Church are each worth 1 additional bonus point for you." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-64-family-burial-plot" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "64" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Family Burial Plot" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Stone" :prerequisites "Stone House" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "When you play this card, you can immediately place the \"Tombstone\" token on an unused farmyard space. That space counts as used but it is blocked for the rest of the game. During scoring, it is worth 1 additional bonus point." :printed-cost {:stone 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-65-fire-brigade" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "65" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Fire Brigade" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Clay,1 Stone" :prerequisites "4 Food and 4 Fuel*" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "When you play this card, you immediately get 2 food. Additionally , if there are forests on at least 2/3/4/5 of your farmyard spaces, you immediately get 1/2/3/4 bonus points. (*Crops and wood do not count but you can exchange them.)" :printed-cost {:clay 1 :stone 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-66-land-parcel" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "66" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Land Parcel" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "At Most 2 Improvements" :points-text "" :passing? false :text "Place 1 forest on an unused farmyard space. During scoring, if you have 1/2/3+ unused farmyard spaces, you get +2/-1/-3 bonus points (on top of the negative points for the unused spaces)." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-67-chamber-of-commerce" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "67" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Chamber of Commerce" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Clay, 1 Stone" :prerequisites "" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "When you play this card, you immediately get 1 wood and 1 reed. During scoring, you get 1 additional bonus point for each of the \"Joinery\", \"Pottery\", and \"Basketmaker's Workshop\" major improvements that you have." :printed-cost {:clay 2 :stone 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-68-church" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "68" :type "Minor/Major Improvement" :name "Church" :min-players 1 :cost-text "Remove Your Village Church* from Play" :prerequisites "" :points-text "5" :passing? false :text "Returning home phase: At most 1 time 1 Fuel → 1 bonus point When you build this upgrade, you immediately get 2 food. (*The Village Church starts under the Well.)" :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-69-leather-saddle" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "69" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Leather Saddle" :min-players 1 :cost-text "1 Food" :prerequisites "2 Horses" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Each time you have at least 3 horses, you get 1 bonus point for each cattle that you turn into food." :printed-cost {:food 1}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-70-moor-archaeology" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "70" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Moor Archaeology" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "Clay House" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "Each time you take the \"Cut Peat\" special action, you can place 1 fence from your supply on the emptied farmyard space. That space counts as used but it is blocked for the rest of the game. During scoring, it is worth 1 additional bonus point." :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-71-bog-body" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "71" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Bog Body" :min-players 1 :cost-text "" :prerequisites "At Least 1 Moor" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "During scoring, the owner of the Museum of the Moors and owner of the Living History Museum each get 1 bonus point. (The Museum of the Moors is a major improvement; the Living History Museum is a minor improvement.)" :printed-cost {}}
   {:id "revised-farmers-of-the-moor-m-72-oven-damper" :edition "Revised" :pack "Farmers of the Moor" :deck "M" :number "72" :type "Minor Improvement" :name "Oven Damper" :min-players 1 :cost-text "2 Stone" :prerequisites "" :points-text "1" :passing? false :text "When you play this card, you immediately get 3 fuel. During scoring, you get 1 additional bonus point each for the \"Clay Oven\", \"Stone Oven\", \"Heating OVen\", and \"Tiled Oven\" major improvements and the \"Oven Installation\" upgrade." :printed-cost {:stone 2}}
